      "writtenOn": "2022-03-09T19:40:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "SkSL::Position currently has two members, a const char* (filename) and a line number. The filename is almost always \"\u003cunknown\u003e\" (anything parsed by DSLParser, afaics)\n\nI\u0027m concerned about growing every single IRNode object by 8 bytes (the cost of the const char*); that\u0027s a nontrivial cost. Will we lose anything if we remove Position::fFile?",
      "revId": "fb907daf7fc995aadc76ea037bd9a8b7d43665f9",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
