      "writtenOn": "2022-03-09T22:47:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We could actually get away with making fKind a uint16, and length a uint16, if we wanted to preserve the IRNode existing size. (Or even fKind:8, length:24, if we are concerned about ridiculously long statements--but I don\u0027t think I am concerned.) I think that\u0027s a safe tradeoff.\n\nI\u0027m OK with this CL, contingent on removing fFile in a followup.",
